

; Vigil (docs/ART.md 11.6): the hand-authored small-caps title font. Capitals 7 px, small
; capitals 5 px (font/vigil/<x>_sc, used for lower-case input and on plaques), lining digits 5x7.
; Glyph pixels are vellum 8 and are recoloured at draw time. Anchor: baseline-left.
